  "slug": "minestrone-soup-in-a-jar-recipe-8350626",
  "name": "Minestrone Soup in a Jar",
  "recipe_type": "soup",
  "brief_description": "We developed this minestrone soup in a jar, inspired by recipes on TikTok for soup in a jar. A great make ahead meal that you can make year round.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stir together vegetable stock base, tomato paste, minced garlic, and Italian seasoning in a small bowl. Divide mixture evenly among 3 microwave-safe pint-size canning jars with lids."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Layer evenly with kidney beans, ditalini pasta, green beans, onion, carrot, and celery. Chill, covered, up to 5 days. To serve, see \u201cHeat and Eat,\u201d below. Garnish with grated Parmesan."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 3,
